  "content": "<p><strong>花叢模組</strong>讓您可以在同一個方塊空間內放置多朵花，類似海鞘和蠟燭的運作方式。只要在花朵上按右鍵放置相同花朵，就會轉變為可容納最多4朵花的花叢。（<strong>不能混合不同種類的花</strong>）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>您也可以對現有的花朵使用骨粉來形成花叢。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz合作夥伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼\"mrbysco\"首次月費可享8折優惠</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有疑問，歡迎加入我的Discord伺服器。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon贊助\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon贊助\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
